Package: veryMAD
Title: Explicit MAD Quality Control and Robust Scaling
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Thomas", "Sirchi", , "thomasirchi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes median absolute deviation quality-control flags and
    robust scaling for numeric metadata, vectors, and matrices. Users select
    the metrics, directions, and transformations; filtering remains in the
    analysis workflow.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    cli,
    matrixStats
Suggests:
    knitr,
    quarto,
    scuttle,
    SeuratObject,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: quarto
